      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "With these conditional probabilities in hand, the expected trait values for the various marker genotypes follow immediately. Suppose there are $N$ QTL genotypes, $Q_{1},\\cdots,Q_{N}$, where the mean of the $k$th QTL genotype is $\\mu_{Q_{k}}$. The mean value for marker genotype $M_{j}$ is just",
