      "content_sha256": "d7a34f778681e004a1e1de78c094983edf08fbbf2f504ec972cf854c1d915e11"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "For RILs and DHLs, the recombination parameter $ \\widetilde{c} $ is given by Equation 15.5b, and from Equations 15.5a and 15.6 it follows that",
